{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on the first stages of a thrilling space adventure combining space traversal, building strategy, and arcade action! As a mousey space cadet, explore the pixelated galaxy and build orbital colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.poster.avif?t=1753879742\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.webm?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/76eb3cc790bc95280478b21e8b08ee6f.mp4?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you mouse enough to defend the galaxy? Well strap in, Cadet! By your intrepid actions, you stand to become the architect of mousekind's next great leap into the cosmos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo of ASTROBURROW, you'll be the arbiter of the first chapter in civilization's history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753879742\" /></div>\u00a0 Learn to mine asteroids for resources, and use your newfound skills to build colonies in 2 unexplored regions of the galaxy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753879742\" /></div>\u00a0 Defend your fellow mice and bring the fight to the Kittylian Empire in 2 side-scrolling SHMUP levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/819c51bd6daf2e0b4a0d6877411f4239.avif?t=1753879742\" /></div>\u00a0 All this, plus 2 unique bosses, and a burgeoning new tech tree that unlocks with the discovery of ancient space artifacts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/62f1aa6d5ae89ab0c2778228f0352a9d.poster.avif?t=1753879742\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/62f1aa6d5ae89ab0c2778228f0352a9d.webm?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/62f1aa6d5ae89ab0c2778228f0352a9d.mp4?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.poster.avif?t=1753879742\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.webm?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/dab1b111aee20a85839185080f3eac22.mp4?t=1753879742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  Continue your adventure in the full game and\u00a0become the architect of mousekind's next great leap into the cosmos. Explore the voids of space, discover ancient moontemples and strange relics, and build a new home for your species-- one pixel at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But it won't be easy: hostile invaders will try to stop you as you grow your new civilization. In this game demo you will need to explore, build and upgrade to ensure your survival. Every new structure, tool and discovery is a step towards victory. Welcome to...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/0da6db27e5484921a918466f51378428.avif?t=1753879742\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classic side-scrolling action meets a strategic base builder in this retro return to arcade delight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/extras/09cdd66d53f85b2c8cbbf35b0a4e7e15.avif?t=1753879742\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3845030?t=1753879742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/c299a669b8a7229f8e044edaf3d9a879e9d92f13/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753879742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/2c418d7bb89e814248067a777eb4e3e598930bf3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753879742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3845030/2c418d7bb89e814248067a777eb4e3e598930bf3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753879742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on the first stages of a thrilling space adventure combining space traversal, building strategy, and arcade action! As a mousey space cadet, explore the pixelated galaxy and build orbital colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_p